"color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-07-01T01:32:44Z","updated_at":"2025-07-20T18:28:41Z","closed_at":"2025-07-19T18:00:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: 4.4.1 and 4.5.beta1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable unknown - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 19 Jun 2025 15:05:14 +0000 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Single-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon 780M Graphics (RADV PHOENIX) - AMD Ryzen 7 7840U w/ Radeon  780M Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe Window Stretch options in the project settings do not behave as expected while using the `integer` scaling mode. Specifically the Stretch Aspect setting `expand` does not behave as I would expect it to. Currently, it takes the full window resolution then scales it down to the nearest integer multiple of the base resolution side length stretching it only horizontally or vertically, where I would expect it to do both. \n\nCurrent behavior:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/12326eb3-55ad-4fe3-871f-fde7aa02106b)\n\nExpected behavior:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/972358b1-9578-447c-bdc1-641a80318ce8)\n\nThe pink rectangle in the screenshots is a test object used to show the base resolution of the game. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a project, in the project settings, go to Display > Window > Stretch and set Mode to either `viewport` or `canvas`, set Aspect to `expand` and set Scale Mode to `integer`. Run the project and resize the window to see how it does not fill the window but does take it's aspect ratio. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[WindowStretchIssueDemo.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20989115/WindowStretchIssueDemo.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"pythongirl325","id":9940914,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NDA5MTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9940914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pythongirl325","html_url":"https://github.com/pythongirl325","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pythongirl325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pythongirl325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pythongirl325/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pythongirl325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pythongirl325/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pythongirl325/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pythongirl325/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pythongirl325/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pythongirl325/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108155/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108155/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_pla